{"title": "Weakened", "pageid": 4347, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Weakened", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Debuff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/300px-Generic_Debuff.webp, /w/images/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp/300px-Generic_Debuff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Generic_Debuff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Weakened</b> is a passive feature found on some <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer\" title=\"Intellect Devourer\">Intellect Devourers</a> that lowers many of its stats.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Its journey through hell has severely weakened this creature's defences. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer_(Weakened)\" title=\"Intellect Devourer (Weakened)\">Intellect Devourer (Weakened)</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This effect reduces the creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> by 5, <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> by 6, and removes its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(Passive_Feature)\" title=\"Darkvision (Passive Feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/38px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/50px-Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision_(Passive_Feature)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Darkvision (Passive Feature)\">Darkvision</a> ability.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 670/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3761/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2120/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 190/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643595/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.482      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.482      1 -total\n 35.27%    9.694      1 Template:SAI\n 32.96%    9.058      1 Template:Icon_link\n 31.78%    8.735      1 Template:Icon_text\n 27.46%    7.546      2 Template:Trim\n 23.76%    6.531      1 Template:Ifempty\n 15.39%    4.229      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.42%    3.962      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 14.25%    3.916      1 Template:Hidden_cod